{"id":"7e87d64375127f0e","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-extended-resolution-soundness.md","title":"Soundness of extended resolution","display":"thm-extended-resolution-soundness — Soundness of extended resolution","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-extended-resolution-soundness","aliases":["72-thm-extended-resolution-soundness"],"display":"thm-extended-resolution-soundness — Soundness of extended resolution","depends_on":["[[72-df-extended-resolution]]","[[72-thm-resolution-soundness]]"],"source_author":"Pavel Pudlák","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local proof from Chapter VIII §8.4; printed p.599; PDF p.611","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"local-proof-checked","source_statement_status":"book construction compared; explicit local formulation distinguished","source_proof_status":"Complete finite gate-extension induction and reduction to resolution soundness","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_date":"2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-extended-resolution-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-extended-resolution-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-extended-resolution-soundness — Soundness of extended resolution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a06ff8011d8167f1\" href=\"?note=a06ff8011d8167f1\" title=\"72-df-extended-resolution\">72-df-extended-resolution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"21921243c3156e00\" href=\"?note=21921243c3156e00\" title=\"72-thm-resolution-soundness\">72-thm-resolution-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Pavel Pudlák"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local proof from Chapter VIII §8.4; printed p.599; PDF p.611"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"book construction compared; explicit local formulation distinguished"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Complete finite gate-extension induction and reduction to resolution soundness"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,V,g,m,\\operatorname{Ext},\\operatorname{Def},\\operatorname{ERRefutation}\">\\(F,V,g,m,\\operatorname{Ext},\\operatorname{Def},\\operatorname{ERRefutation}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a06ff8011d8167f1\" href=\"?note=a06ff8011d8167f1\" title=\"72-df-extended-resolution\">72-df-extended-resolution</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,b_t\">\\(D,b_t\\)</span> 取其门子句上游；归结可靠性取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"21921243c3156e00\" href=\"?note=21921243c3156e00\" title=\"72-thm-resolution-soundness\">72-thm-resolution-soundness</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_g\">\\(Q_g\\)</span> 由 Assertion 定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^V\">\\(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 为有限子句序列。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q_g:=\\{e_i:i&lt;m\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q_g:=\\{e_i:i&lt;m\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}(V,g)\\to\n\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V}\\;\\exists! b\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V\\cup Q_g}\\;\n\\bigl(b\\upharpoonright V=a\\land b\\models_{\\rm cnf}\\operatorname{Def}(g)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}(V,g)\\to\n\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V}\\;\\exists! b\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V\\cup Q_g}\\;\n\\bigl(b\\upharpoonright V=a\\land b\\models_{\\rm cnf}\\operatorname{Def}(g)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ERRefutation}(\\pi,F,V,g)\\to\\operatorname{Unsat}(F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ERRefutation}(\\pi,F,V,g)\\to\\operatorname{Unsat}(F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明与第VIII章 §8.4 的扩展公理构造相应，不依赖尚未重建的扩展Frege模拟。</p>\n<p>沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 递归，对已有赋值增加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_i\">\\(e_i\\)</span> 的值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_{t_i}(b(x_{i,0}),\\ldots)\">\\(b_{t_i}(b(x_{i,0}),\\ldots)\\)</span>。输入均已有值且输出名新鲜，故每步存在唯一扩张；门子句等价式给出全部定义子句为真。反过来，任意满足门子句的扩张逐门被同一布尔函数强制，故唯一。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 可满足，先把赋值补到有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>，再由上述扩张得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\cup\\operatorname{Def}(g)\">\\(F\\cup\\operatorname{Def}(g)\\)</span> 的满足赋值，与已有归结反驳的可靠性矛盾。特别地，空门序列也覆盖；新鲜性与无环性在 Hypothesis/Assertion 中明确承担必要条件，不能从结论中删除。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-extended-resolution","status":"resolved","id":"a06ff8011d8167f1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-extended-resolution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-resolution-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"21921243c3156e00","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-resolution-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-extended-resolution","status":"resolved","id":"a06ff8011d8167f1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F,V,g,m,\\operatorname{Ext},\\operatorname{Def},\\operatorname{ERRefutation}$ 取 [[72-df-extended-resolution]]；$D,b_t$ 取其门子句上游；归结可靠性取 [[72-thm-resolution-soundness]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-resolution-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"21921243c3156e00","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F,V,g,m,\\operatorname{Ext},\\operatorname{Def},\\operatorname{ERRefutation}$ 取 [[72-df-extended-resolution]]；$D,b_t$ 取其门子句上游；归结可靠性取 [[72-thm-resolution-soundness]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F,V,g,m,\\operatorname{Ext},\\operatorname{Def},\\operatorname{ERRefutation}","display":false},{"tex":"D,b_t","display":false},{"tex":"Q_g","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^V","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"Q_g:=\\{e_i:i<m\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ext}(V,g)\\to\n\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V}\\;\\exists! b\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V\\cup Q_g}\\;\n\\bigl(b\\upharpoonright V=a\\land b\\models_{\\rm cnf}\\operatorname{Def}(g)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ERRefutation}(\\pi,F,V,g)\\to\\operatorname{Unsat}(F).","display":true},{"tex":"i<m","display":false},{"tex":"e_i","display":false},{"tex":"b_{t_i}(b(x_{i,0}),\\ldots)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"F\\cup\\operatorname{Def}(g)","display":false}],"bytes":2385,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-269","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-extended-resolution-soundness|thm-extended-resolution-soundness — Soundness of extended resolution]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-269","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-extended-resolution-soundness|thm-extended-resolution-soundness — Soundness of extended resolution]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-287","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-extended-resolution-soundness|72-thm-extended-resolution-soundness]]"}],"outgoing":["a06ff8011d8167f1","21921243c3156e00"]}